<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>You have been selected for the <a href="https://students.asu.edu/obama.">Obama Scholars Program</a>.</b> Our mission at ASU is to make college as affordable as possible. With this program, there is no need for repayment and it will cover your direct costs of attendance for up to four years.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Your Financial Aid Notification is now posted in <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a> under the <b>Finances</b> tab. Please take advantage of our <a href="https://students.asu.edu/financialaid/budget">Student Budget Worksheet</a> to determine if you want to accept, modify or decline any part of your financial aid package.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">I also encourage you to <a href="https://psa.asu.edu/content/apply-ngsc">apply</a> to the <a href="https://psa.asu.edu/next-generation-service-corps">Next Generation Service Corps</a> through the <a href="https://psa.asu.edu/">Public Service Academy</a>. This four-year leadership and career development program trains future leaders like you to serve the greater good through your career path.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>&nbsp;</b></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Complete your Priority Tasks in <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a>:</b></font></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;">pay your <a href="https://students.asu.edu/freshman/deposit">enrollment deposit</a>*</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">confirm your <a href="https://housing.asu.edu/">housing preferences</a></span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">sign up for <a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/orientation">orientation</a></span></li><li>take the&nbsp;<a href="https://students.asu.edu/math">math placement test</a></li><li>submit your&nbsp;<a href="https://eoss.asu.edu/health/services/immunization">MMR immunization records</a></li></ul></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">*As a Federal Pell Grant recipient, you have the opportunity to <a href="https://asu.secure.force.com/kb/articles/FAQ/How-do-I-defer-my-enrollment-deposit/?q=enrollment&amp;l=en_US&amp;fs=Search&amp;pn=1">defer your enrollment deposit</a>.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions, please feel free to contact me or <a href="https://students.asu.edu/contact/financialaid">Financial Aid and Scholarship Services</a>. I'd also be happy to discuss the costs and paying for your education.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}<br><br></font><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>